  "title": "Cosmopsychism",
  "role": "model",
  "summary": "Cosmopsychism, as Philip Goff, Yujin Nagasawa and Khai Wager, and Itay Shani and Joachim Keppler defend it: the universe as a whole is conscious, cosmic consciousness is ontologically prior to the consciousness of humans and animals, and ordinary subjects are derived from it, which trades the combination problem of panpsychism for a de-combination problem.",
